  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ContactPoint · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~17 characters
  /// shown through Osysharp.Conversations.ContactPoint.VerifiedBy
  /// beside: "Party", "Kind", "Value", "Verified key", "Verified at", "Asserted by"
  label "Verified by" => "تحقق منه";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ContactPoint · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~18 characters
