  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {blanked} = blanked (int) — {blanked} is a count: give one text per plural form
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A customer's words were erased on request. Messages blanked: {blanked}. The timeline keeps its shape." => { zero: "مُحيت كلمات عميل بناءً على طلبه. لم تُفرَّغ أي رسالة. ويبقى الخط الزمني على شكله.", one: "مُحيت كلمات عميل بناءً على طلبه. فُرّغت رسالة واحدة. ويبقى الخط الزمني على شكله.", two: "مُحيت كلمات عميل بناءً على طلبه. فُرّغت رسالتان. ويبقى الخط الزمني على شكله.", few: "مُحيت كلمات عميل بناءً على طلبه. فُرّغت {blanked} رسائل. ويبقى الخط الزمني على شكله.", many: "مُحيت كلمات عميل بناءً على طلبه. فُرّغت {blanked} رسالة. ويبقى الخط الزمني على شكله.", other: "مُحيت كلمات عميل بناءً على طلبه. فُرّغت {blanked} رسالة. ويبقى الخط الزمني على شكله." };
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {who} = who (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A message from {who} was split off into a conversation of its own." => "فُصلت رسالة من {who} إلى محادثة مستقلة.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {who} = who (string), {why} = why (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A message from {who} was split off into a conversation of its own: “{why}”." => "فُصلت رسالة من {who} إلى محادثة مستقلة: «{why}».";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {happened.Person} = happened.Person (string), {why} = why (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A side conversation with {happened.Person} was started: “{why}”." => "بدأت محادثة جانبية مع {happened.Person}: “{why}”.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {why} = why (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "A thread inside the team was started beside this: “{why}”." => "بدأت سلسلة رسائل داخل الفريق بجانب هذه: “{why}”.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// placeholders: {happened.Person} = happened.Person (string)
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "An automatic reply from {happened.Person} was received and not answered." => "وصل رد تلقائي من {happened.Person} ولم يُرَدّ عليه.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
  /// shown through EventSentence()
  text "An automatic reply was received and not answered." => "وصل رد تلقائي ولم يُرَدّ عليه.";
  /// Osysharp.Conversations.ConversationCopy.EventSentence · text on the page
